1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,950
Only one hundred thousand a month.

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:06,120
But nobody told you the total.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,300
Master, it's only one hundred thousand a month!

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,840
I can easily afford it.

5
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:14,210
For how many months?

6
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:15,660
How much will you pay in total?

7
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:18,450
One hundred thousand...

8
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,670
twelve months...

9
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:24,060
one million two hundred thousand.

10
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:27,630
Now add the down payment,

11
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,360
and the service fee?

12
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:33,660
The seller only told me the monthly payment.

13
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:36,430
I didn't ask the cash price.

14
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:41,030
A price cut into small pieces hides a big total.

15
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:43,440
Put the two side by side.

16
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,310
Ask three questions.

17
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,680
What's the cash price?

18
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:51,240
How much will I pay in total?

19
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:53,590
What happens if I'm late?

20
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:55,900
I'm not in a hurry.

21
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,600
I'll do the math first.

22
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:02,220
After «only ... a month» one question is left:

23
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:04,690
how much in total, in the end?

24
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:09,800
Send a photo of the price tag or the contract to our bot:

25
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:10,800
@sahiychishopbot

26
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,000
It works out how much you'll pay in total,

27
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,060
and tells you which questions to ask the seller.

